## Changed

- Made state revision the atomic authority token. Sample validation and publication now occur in one `SubscriptionRef.modify` transition; navigation advances the same token atomically.
- Transferred sampling-lane ownership directly into its coalesced follow-up, so the lane is never idle between completion and that pass.
- Changed the daemon event bridge to a scoped `Stream.callback` with bounded/drop buffers; attempt terminals and snapshot reset signals are bounded.
- Drained every snapshot token at each retry boundary, preventing extra snapshots from resetting later failed attempts.
- Added deterministic daemon-stream `TestClock` retry coverage and multi-snapshot reset coverage; retained active-attempt/retry-wait interruption coverage.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/provider.ts`, `packages/music-core/tests/session-coordinator.test.ts`, `packages/music-core/tests/system-media.test.ts`.

